{"title":"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c99bbe74cccdc92b249d376f13d9429d41a8b7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />. If there is a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> strictly between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aa386dfcb7ef3fdecb8d1546b691fa2e545fe6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP=PC=CB$\" width=\"133\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/6/7464663f6b92ef5375dc2e4e579803e72506c40e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A =$\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302d3a9db01baaf4d628ba609f3c472775915aab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(8,0)--(4,12)--cycle); draw((8,0)--(1.6,4.8)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (4,12), N); label(&quot;B&quot;, (0,0), W); label(&quot;C&quot;, (8,0), E); label(&quot;P&quot;, (1.6,4.8), NW); dot((0,0)); dot((4,12)); dot((8,0)); dot((1.6,4.8)); [/asy]\" width=\"192\" height=\"252\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70fc5e0621be71ad82253b033cb2f8ae56b55880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 30^{\\circ} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 36^{\\circ} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 48^{\\circ} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 60^{\\circ} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 72^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"431\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/0/f709c37e24897f2561386ad8f16b0fa59320c00e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import cse5; pathpen=black; pointpen=black; pair A=(4,12),B=(0,0),C=(8,0),P=(1.6,4.8); D(MP(&quot;A&quot;,A,N)--MP(&quot;B&quot;,B,W)--MP(&quot;C&quot;,C,E)--cycle); D(C--MP(&quot;P&quot;,P,NW)); D(A);D(B);D(C);D(P); MA(&quot;x&quot;,10,B,A,C,1,1); MA(&quot;x&quot;,10,A,C,P,1,1); MA(-20,&quot;180-2x&quot;,8,C,P,A,1,2); MA(&quot;2x&quot;,10,B,P,C,1,3,blue); MA(&quot;2x&quot;,10,C,B,P,1,3,blue);[/asy]\" width=\"472\" height=\"668\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5865a9a81df0ab0c4a7b33b4e6ae99431597238d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A=x$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/3/de37cf80cd865dae47a1ed73bd23237c0eb03982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP=PC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/9/b39e77ead7e140f046e9dbe3372a65ae2c648ea8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACP=x$\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" /> as well. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40d4ba391d0fa603bd0bfba6d8e7b536b726ad20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APC=180-2x\\implies\\angle BPC=\\angle CBP=2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"377\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c99bbe74cccdc92b249d376f13d9429d41a8b7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/8/b08ae56fe38ac4c580a6434412b68fad42892765.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CBP=\\frac{180-x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"142\" height=\"37\" />. \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0d7039be1e23e554a2b4bb5fa35b77b65643c66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x=\\frac{180-x}{2}\\implies 5x=180\\implies x=\\angle A=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }36^\\circ.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"442\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n--Solution by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=200685\">TheMaskedMagician</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME\" title=\"1994 AHSME\">1994 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/F